SUBJ/TROPICAL CYCLONE FORMATION ALERT//
WTPN22 PHNC 270300
REF/A/JOINT TYPHOON WRNCEN PEARL HARBOR HI/270300Z AUG 26//
AMPN/REF IS TROPICAL CYCLONE FORMATION ALERT (WTPN21 PHNC 270300)//
RMKS/
1. FORMATION OF A SIGNIFICANT TROPICAL CYCLONE IS POSSIBLE WITHIN
A 170 NM RADIUS OF 11.6N 134.4W WITHIN THE NEXT 12 TO 24 HOURS.
AVAILABLE DATA DOES NOT JUSTIFY ISSUANCE OF NUMBERED TROPICAL
CYCLONE WARNINGS AT THIS TIME. WINDS IN THE AREA ARE ESTIMATED TO
BE 18 TO 23 KNOTS. METSAT IMAGERY AT 270300Z INDICATES THAT A
CIRCULATION CENTER IS LOCATED NEAR 10.9N 135.0W. THE SYSTEM IS
MOVING NORTH-NORTHEASTWARD AT 03 KNOTS.
2. REMARKS:
MAXIMUM SUSTAINED SURFACE WINDS ARE ESTIMATED AT 18 TO 23 KNOTS.
MINIMUM SEA LEVEL PRESSURE IS ESTIMATED TO BE NEAR 1005 MB. THE
POTENTIAL FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF A SIGNIFICANT TROPICAL CYCLONE
WITHIN THE NEXT 24 HOURS IS HIGH.
3. THIS ALERT WILL BE REISSUED, UPGRADED TO WARNING OR CANCELLED BY 280300Z.
4. SEE REF A FOR DETAILS ON A TROPICAL CYCLONE FORMATION ALERT
LOCATED NEAR 9.5N 107.5W
